{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Use case: stylized-concept.\\nCreate a landscape 3:2 Minecraft builder reference sheet, crisp voxel style, vanilla Minecraft blocks only, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side: LEFT a straight-on front elevation, orthographic; RIGHT an elevated three-quarter view at the same scale that reveals the east passage and rear garden. Show the same complete build in both views. Skilled human builder quality: real massing and depth, projecting pilasters and cornices, recessed framed openings, real roof verges, eaves and ridge, stairs, slabs, fences, walls, trapdoors and lanterns. Keep all geometry on a believable Minecraft block grid.\\nSite: A narrow, handsome red-brick shop house standing alone on its plot in a shopping street, its steep dark-slate gable facing the road. At pavement level a tall open shopfront nine blocks wide sits between two dark-oak pilasters. Behind the counters, butcher's goods show as pink_terracotta pork chops, brown_mushroom_block baked chicken and red_terracotta steaks, all block-built. Over the shopfront runs a deep maroon red_nether_bricks fascia lettered exactly BUTCHER in white_banner/white_wall_banner white lettering, with a red_wool and white_wool striped awning hanging from it. A dark_oak_hanging_sign juts from the right-hand pilaster. To the left is a smaller bay with the family's own dark_oak_door double door, a glass_pane fanlight and a little dark-oak timber hood with a lantern at each end. Above, a crisp smooth_quartz cornice carries two storeys of bricks with three paired sash windows per floor, set back into the wall under white smooth_quartz lintels, with dark_oak_trapdoor shutters on the top floor. White smooth_quartz quoins climb the corners. The gable has a small loft window and dark-oak verges with a deepslate slate ridge, and a dormer pokes from each side slope. A tall brick chimney with a deepslate_bricks dark band and smoking campfire cap rises up the east side beside a gravel passage that leads to a spruce_fence_gate garden gate with a spruce_fence lamp post and lantern. Behind, a lower two-storey brick back wing runs off the west half under its own slate gable, with a smoking kitchen chimney on its end. The rest of the back is a spruce-fenced kitchen garden: farmland beds of carrots, potatoes, beetroots and wheat with water channels, dirt_path paths from the kitchen door and the shop's back door, composter compost bins, a water_cauldron water butt, a spruce_stairs/spruce_slab bench and an oak_log/oak_leaves apple tree in the far corner. Use oak_leaves to suggest the apple tree without adding non-vanilla fruit blocks.\\nSize: plot 28 blocks wide, 39 deep; house 16 x 18 with an 8 x 9 rear wing; 3 storeys (shop + 2 home floors) plus gable loft; ridge about 33 blocks high. Preserve the narrow tall proportions and distinctly lower rear wing.\\nExact permitted block palette by role (ids describe construction materials, do not print this long palette on the sheet): {\\\"ground\\\":[\\\"dirt\\\",\\\"stone\\\"],\\\"street\\\":[\\\"andesite\\\",\\\"polished_andesite\\\",\\\"smooth_stone\\\"],\\\"walls\\\":[\\\"bricks\\\",\\\"brick_stairs\\\",\\\"brick_slab\\\",\\\"brick_wall\\\"],\\\"trim\\\":[\\\"smooth_quartz\\\",\\\"smooth_quartz_stairs\\\",\\\"smooth_quartz_slab\\\"],\\\"plinth\\\":[\\\"polished_deepslate\\\",\\\"polished_deepslate_stairs\\\"],\\\"joinery\\\":[\\\"stripped_dark_oak_log\\\",\\\"dark_oak_planks\\\",\\\"dark_oak_stairs\\\",\\\"dark_oak_slab\\\",\\\"dark_oak_door\\\",\\\"dark_oak_trapdoor\\\",\\\"dark_oak_fence\\\",\\\"dark_oak_fence_gate\\\",\\\"dark_oak_hanging_sign\\\",\\\"dark_oak_wall_sign\\\",\\\"dark_oak_pressure_plate\\\"],\\\"fascia\\\":[\\\"red_nether_bricks\\\",\\\"white_banner\\\",\\\"white_wall_banner\\\"],\\\"awning\\\":[\\\"red_wool\\\",\\\"white_wool\\\"],\\\"roof\\\":[\\\"deepslate_tiles\\\",\\\"cobbled_deepslate\\\",\\\"polished_deepslate\\\",\\\"deepslate_tile_slab\\\",\\\"deepslate_tile_stairs\\\",\\\"cobbled_deepslate_stairs\\\",\\\"cobbled_deepslate_slab\\\",\\\"polished_deepslate_slab\\\",\\\"deepslate_bricks\\\",\\\"dark_oak_planks\\\"],\\\"chimney\\\":[\\\"bricks\\\",\\\"deepslate_bricks\\\",\\\"brick_slab\\\",\\\"hay_block\\\",\\\"campfire\\\"],\\\"glass\\\":[\\\"glass_pane\\\"],\\\"floors\\\":[\\\"stone_bricks\\\",\\\"spruce_planks\\\",\\\"oak_planks\\\",\\\"bricks\\\",\\\"smooth_quartz\\\"],\\\"furniture\\\":[\\\"spruce_stairs\\\",\\\"spruce_slab\\\",\\\"spruce_fence\\\",\\\"spruce_trapdoor\\\",\\\"oak_stairs\\\",\\\"oak_slab\\\",\\\"oak_fence\\\",\\\"oak_trapdoor\\\",\\\"barrel\\\",\\\"bookshelf\\\",\\\"red_bed\\\",\\\"red_carpet\\\",\\\"white_carpet\\\",\\\"furnace\\\",\\\"smoker\\\",\\\"blast_furnace\\\",\\\"crafting_table\\\",\\\"cauldron\\\",\\\"candle\\\",\\\"red_candle\\\",\\\"flower_pot\\\",\\\"iron_chain\\\"],\\\"garden\\\":[\\\"grass_block\\\",\\\"coarse_dirt\\\",\\\"podzol\\\",\\\"dirt_path\\\",\\\"gravel\\\",\\\"farmland\\\",\\\"water\\\",\\\"carrots\\\",\\\"potatoes\\\",\\\"beetroots\\\",\\\"wheat\\\",\\\"spruce_fence\\\",\\\"spruce_fence_gate\\\",\\\"spruce_slab\\\",\\\"composter\\\",\\\"water_cauldron\\\",\\\"oak_log\\\",\\\"oak_leaves\\\"],\\\"tenant\\\":[\\\"pink_terracotta\\\",\\\"brown_mushroom_block\\\",\\\"red_terracotta\\\",\\\"hay_block\\\"]}.\\nAdditional permitted functional/decor ids: lantern, ladder, campfire, barrel, cauldron, water_cauldron, iron_chain, white_banner, white_wall_banner, dark_oak_hanging_sign, dark_oak_wall_sign, flower_pot, composter.\\nAvoid invented block types, smooth non-voxel geometry, floating roof edges, neighboring buildings, extra views, perspective in the left elevation, and hidden or cropped roof tops. Use restrained soft lighting and sharp readable block textures.\",\n  \"roles\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"ground\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"dirt\", \"stone\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"street\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"andesite\", \"polished_andesite\", \"smooth_stone\", \"stone_bricks\", \"stone_brick_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"walls\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"bricks\", \"brick_stairs\", \"brick_slab\", \"brick_wall\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"trim\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"smooth_quartz\", \"smooth_quartz_stairs\", \"smooth_quartz_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"plinth\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"polished_deepslate\", \"polished_deepslate_stairs\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"joinery\",\n      \"blocks\": [\n        \"stripped_dark_oak_log\",\n        \"dark_oak_planks\",\n        \"dark_oak_stairs\",\n        \"dark_oak_slab\",\n        \"dark_oak_door\",\n        \"dark_oak_trapdoor\",\n        \"dark_oak_fence\",\n        \"dark_oak_fence_gate\",\n        \"dark_oak_hanging_sign\",\n        \"dark_oak_wall_sign\",\n        \"dark_oak_pressure_plate\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"fascia\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"red_nether_bricks\", \"white_banner\", \"white_wall_banner\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"awning\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"red_wool\", \"white_wool\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"roof\",\n      \"blocks\": [\n        \"deepslate_tiles\",\n        \"cobbled_deepslate\",\n        \"polished_deepslate\",\n        \"deepslate_tile_slab\",\n        \"deepslate_tile_stairs\",\n        \"cobbled_deepslate_stairs\",\n        \"cobbled_deepslate_slab\",\n        \"polished_deepslate_slab\",\n        \"deepslate_bricks\",\n        \"dark_oak_planks\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"chimney\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"bricks\", \"deepslate_bricks\", \"brick_slab\", \"hay_block\", \"campfire\", \"deepslate_brick_slab\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"glass\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"glass_pane\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"floors\",\n      \"blocks\": [\"stone_bricks\", \"spruce_planks\", \"oak_planks\", \"bricks\", \"smooth_quartz\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"furniture\",\n      \"blocks\": [\n       